1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,730
Writing, task two. E-mail number 4: Booking a room.

2
00:00:06,433 --> 00:00:17,250
You want to go on holiday to Šumava with your family. Write an e-mail to the hotel. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

3
00:00:25,933 --> 00:00:27,000
Good afternoon,

4
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,573
I would like to book a room in your hotel.

5
00:00:29,867 --> 00:00:34,306
We will arrive on Friday 10 July and leave on Sunday 19 July.

6
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:37,464
There will be three of us: me, my wife and my son.

7
00:00:37,767 --> 00:00:39,916
We would like a family room with a balcony.

8
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:42,469
We would like breakfast and dinner at the hotel.

9
00:00:42,767 --> 00:00:45,567
We're coming by car, we need a parking space.

10
00:00:45,867 --> 00:00:48,401
Thank you, I look forward to your reply.

11
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:56,141
This e-mail has 52 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

12
00:00:56,833 --> 00:01:05,844
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
